Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 18:28:33 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] fix(backend): refuse one physical camera twice in an
 environment

Two rows of one device (a RealSense as "color" and again as "depth") made
their publishers replace each other forever. Saving such an environment is
refused (422 camera_device_conflict) and so is loading one, naming both
cameras and, for a RealSense, pointing to output "Color + depth".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
